    -> Filter: ((distance(t2.v,<cache>(to_vector('[0, 0, 0]')),'EUCLIDEAN') <= 2.5) and (t2.id < 3))  (cost=X rows=2)
        -> Index range scan on t2 using PRIMARY over (id < 3)  (cost=X rows=2)
    -> Single-row covering index lookup on t3 using PRIMARY (id = t2.id)  (cost=X rows=1)

